"2.x) et ZUGFeRD 1.0 : fichier PDF contenant une pièce jointe XML au format "
"CrossIndustryInvoice."

#. module: account_invoice_import_facturx
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_invoice_import_facturx/wizard/account_invoice_import.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"AllowanceTotalAmount (%(total)s) doesn't match the sum of the allowance "
"lines (%(sum_lines)s). Maybe it is because the Factur-X XML file is at BASIC"
" level, and we don't have the details of taxes for the allowance lines."
msgstr ""
"AllowanceTotalAmount (%(total)s) ne correspond pas à la somme des lignes de "
"remise (%(sum_lines)s). Le fichier XML Factur-X est peut-être au niveau "
"BASIC, qui ne donne pas le détail des taxes des lignes de remise."

#. module: account_invoice_import_facturx
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_invoice_import_facturx/wizard/account_invoice_import.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"ChargeTotalAmount (%(total_charge)s) doesn't match the sum of the charge "
"lines (%(sum_lines)s). Maybe it is because the Factur-X XML file is at BASIC"
" level, and we don't have the details of taxes for the charge lines."
msgstr ""
"ChargeTotalAmount (%(total_charge)s) ne correspond pas à la somme des lignes"
" de frais (%(sum_lines)s). Le fichier XML Factur-X est peut-être au niveau "
"BASIC, qui ne donne pas le détail des taxes des lignes de frais."

